# ── Docker build context = REPO ROOT ────────────────────────────────────────
# backend-b/ sets  image_build_context ".."  so its image can COPY the shared
# semantius CLI from linux-x64/. That makes the whole repo the build context,
# so exclude everything heavy or irrelevant here — the image only ever COPYs
# linux-x64/ .
**/node_modules
**/.wrangler
**/.flue-vite
**/dist
**/dist-bundle
.git
.claude
.agents
.patch-ds
frontend
core
scripts
patches
*.tsbuildinfo
.api-token
